description: Batch is a French customer engagement platform (CEP) for CRM teams. It enables marketers to personalize, predict and automate email, SMS and push notification campaigns from one platform. The Batch Web SDK embedded on websites collects user and browsing data for audience segmentation and powers web push notifications.

